---
import { AppNav } from "../components/AppNav";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="Legal & privacy · Major Winners"
	description="How play is stored, what sign-in is for, and the fan-project disclaimer."
>
	<div class="min-h-dvh bg-black text-zinc-100">
		<AppNav client:load showLegal={false} />

		<main
			class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-[max(1.5rem,var(--safe-left))] pb-[max(3rem,var(--safe-bottom))] pr-[max(1.5rem,var(--safe-right))] pt-8 sm:pt-12"
		>
			<p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-zinc-400">
				Major Winners
			</p>
			<h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white sm:text-4xl">
				Legal & privacy
			</h1>

			<section class="mt-10" aria-labelledby="privacy-heading">
				<h2
					id="privacy-heading"
					class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white"
				>
					Privacy
				</h2>
				<div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
					<p>
						Your games stay in this browser—drafts, Daily runs, Free Play, and match playback. No
						ads, no analytics.
					</p>
					<p>
						Sign-in is optional. A magic link ties your teams and scores to your email so they
						follow you on other browsers and devices. You can still save teams without an account.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="mt-10" aria-labelledby="legal-heading">
				<h2
					id="legal-heading"
					class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white"
				>
					Fan project
				</h2>
				<div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
					<p>
						Major Winners is an unofficial, non-commercial fan game. It is not affiliated with,
						endorsed by, or sponsored by Valve, Counter-Strike, HLTV, Liquipedia, or any team,
						player, coach, or tournament organizer named here.
					</p>
					<p>
						Major roster, placement, and event metadata are adapted from
						<a
							class="text-emerald-200 underline decoration-emerald-200/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-emerald-200"
							href="https://liquipedia.net/counterstrike"
							>Liquipedia Counter-Strike</a
						>
						contributors and distributed under
						<a
							class="text-emerald-200 underline decoration-emerald-200/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-emerald-200"
							href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/us/"
							>CC BY-SA 3.0 US</a
						>. Individual season statistics are transcribed from public HLTV player pages.
					</p>
					<p>
						Organization marks, Major crests, and player portraits are trademarks and copyrighted
						works of their owners. They appear only to identify historical rosters and events, and
						are removed on request by the rights holder.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<p class="mt-12">
				<a
					href="/"
					class="inline-flex border border-white/20 bg-transparent px-5 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white transition hover:border-white/50 hover:bg-white/5 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#e53935]"
				>
					Back to Home
				</a>
			</p>
		</main>
	</div>
</Layout>
